# Project doctrine

## Purpose
Every Partner invoice reaches Ledgerly exactly once, within 5 minutes of
receipt, and Finance can reconcile the nightly CSV against Ledgerly.

## Platform pins
- Node 22 (base image node:22-slim).
- PostgreSQL 16 (managed instance).

## Constraints
- Ledgerly is the system of record.

## Accepted decisions
- None recorded yet.

## Known debt
- None recorded.

## Settings
- Ledger: on
